        <mxCell id="vNBhxsl-8KsPASfX1VSI-11" parent="vNBhxsl-8KsPASfX1VSI-1" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=12;image=img/lib/azure2/general/Folder_Blank.svg;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;pegaverse-portal&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="48.00000000000001" width="59.14" x="425" y="31.111111111111114" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vNBhxsl-8KsPASfX1VSI-12" parent="vNBhxsl-8KsPASfX1VSI-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=16;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original (Left):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Phidias is located inside pegaverse-portal&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Phidias shares the CI/CD pipeline with pegaverse-portal&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Phidias is not a git submodule&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Phidias contains its own next.config.ts and package.json, preserving its independent dependency managements&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Standalone: Phidias builds its own project with pnpm run build and serve the static files in SPA mode (&lt;b&gt;CSR&lt;/b&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Web component: Phidias uses pnpm run build to build static files. Copy the built files of Phidias, move it to public folder in pegaverse-portal client, and let pegaverse-portal buid and serve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="318.89" width="320" x="40" y="281.11" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vNBhxsl-8KsPASfX1VSI-13" parent="vNBhxsl-8KsPASfX1VSI-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=16;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;New (Right):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Phidias has its independent repository&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Phidias has its own CI/CD pipeline&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Pegaverse-portal&lt;b&gt; installs phidias-types&lt;/b&gt; in build time&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Pegaverse-portal &lt;b&gt;imports phidias&lt;/b&gt; conditionally and dynamically in run time&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Standalone: Same as the original but can be done with next commands in an exclusive Dockerfile for client (need to enable &lt;b&gt;server-side&lt;/b&gt; api routing)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Web component: Phidias uses pnpm run build or next export to create static files. Mount the static scripts to CDN (ingress on k8s), and import dynamically on pegaverse-portal. (with import() function or inject &amp;lt;script&amp;gt; in render tree.)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="308.89" width="314.5" x="400" y="281.11" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
