        <mxCell id="LfwqF-Rkq7OdKXcgeoPA-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 130%;&quot;&gt;Rate limit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;algorithm: leaky bucket (smooth traffic)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;rate: 60 rpm&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;burst: 20 rps (requests will be enqueued into each services)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;limited requests: &lt;b&gt;POST&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 130%;&quot;&gt;Concurrency&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;allows at most 2 concurrent requests from a single IP&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
