        <mxCell id="LfwqF-Rkq7OdKXcgeoPA-52" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 15.6px;&quot;&gt;Timeout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Qwen: 420 s&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;ReconViaGen: 360 s&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;P3SAM: 360 s&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; line-height: 140%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; line-height: 140%;&quot;&gt;Nginx-level error&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;429 (Too Many Requests):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;1. request frequency greater than 20 rps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;2. more than 2 concurrent requests from a sing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;le IP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;504 (Gateway Timeou&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;t):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The request will be interrupted with 504 once the timeout has been reached.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
